{"version":1,"key":"card:466","content":{"id":466,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f5ff9a2b-055a-4d1d-be50-c34d4c0e1272","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"try/except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句来捕获异常"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"a75ff9c2-d97b-4a8d-a10e-fee9b62ce081","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b210a6ab-da3b-480c-a52e-8b878083702e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    x = int(input('Enter the first number: '))\n    y = int(input('Enter the second number: '))\n    print(x / y)\nexcept ZeroDivisionError:\n    print(\"The second number can't be zero!\")","collabId":"8226368f-6082-42b6-b542-1fd70d5ba7fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"3ee3bcea-a105-4d5f-a1dc-14190f5c4092","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d4b4a26-7ed1-4b2f-a164-b642626f0fd3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"异常从函数向外传播到调用函数的地方。如果在这里也没有被捕获，异常将向程序的最顶层传播。这意味着你可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"try/except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来捕获他人所编写函数引发的异常。"}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"6eda8153-8836-415a-8925-d5e15d544dad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9babb725-30c0-4b52-8627-2aba1731c648","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"捕获异常后，如果要重新引发它（即继续向上传播），可调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"raise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 且不提供任何参数。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"48e8f15c-da66-4bdb-a635-79a6b4047470","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1d3d8c1d-80d1-4b37-9927-9667a9a16ac3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class MuffledCalculator:\n    muffled = False\n    def calc(self, expr):\n      try:\n          return eval(expr)\n      except ZeroDivisionError:\n          if self.muffled:\n              print('Division by zero is illegal')\n          else:\n              raise","collabId":"faad32f4-95cb-4533-b080-7b3ae59b3c96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f32a3bb8-5215-4f9f-86ec-44fdce2de29e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果捕获后想引发别的异常。在这种情况下，导致进入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句的异常将被作为异常上下文存储起来，并出现在最终的错误消息中"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"22b86d9b-41fd-4761-96ef-c65c8e06de94","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9c16d4ad-80ed-4661-9bcd-dd9fa417f343","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> try:\n...      1/0\n... except ZeroDivisionError:\n...      raise ValueError\n...\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 2, in <module>\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 4, in <module>\nValueError","collabId":"e8aba281-5cca-4204-985f-ff0c0f4e0d44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d058416-c8b0-4ae3-83f2-2d525845b1f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"raise ... from ..."},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句来提供自己的异常上下文，也可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来禁用上下文"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"d415c903-4087-418e-ab53-93badd28fc11","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e18cb67b-1a78-423a-ac2e-8ebaf2ea40a2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> try:\n...      1/0\n... except ZeroDivisionError:\n...      raise ValueError from None\n...\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 4, in <module>\nValueError","collabId":"0762c915-7c5b-4198-8a05-b7424da67462","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"0bb485e6-d7b4-472e-bd7c-75159d9867ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"18f7c328-1d0b-4e19-aea4-27a81a435f2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"try/except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中再添加多个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"026bd13c-ee6d-4726-8cc4-b27cfc5ed950","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"43a09982-30c8-49af-96c2-937f96fdab27","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    x = int(input('Enter the first number: '))\n    y = int(input('Enter the second number: '))\n    print(x / y)\nexcept ZeroDivisionError:\n    print(\"The second number can't be zero!\")\nexcept TypeError:\n    print(\"That wasn't a number, was it?\")","collabId":"c0d62a30-ac2c-42c9-b138-3762a4cbfa67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b5707adf-1973-4874-9c5d-f76e1d49a3f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果要使用一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句捕获多种异常，可在一个元组中指定这些异常"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"b6ed2e10-f54c-4425-8dd2-be1c4535009e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"435516c1-fd2f-46e3-86ea-85f430e17b4b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    x = int(input('Enter the first number: '))\n    y = int(input('Enter the second number: '))\n    print(x / y)\nexcept (ZeroDivisionError, TypeError, NameError):\n    print('Your numbers were bogus ...')","collabId":"0732830e-9dea-4255-b716-bc1218996c0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"5e7c8033-cf0a-434b-8c9c-0aef3ead27f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"848e8dce-e645-455d-8489-b7cb450b3251","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句中访问异常对象本身，可使用两个而不是一个参数。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"78226fdd-b773-4df3-8ff2-f88f8569c3c2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1387bc5c-d07a-476e-83c3-78a73a9d1566","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    x = int(input('Enter the first number: '))\n    y = int(input('Enter the second number: '))\n    print(x / y)\nexcept (ZeroDivisionError, TypeError) as e:\n    print(e)","collabId":"533ca2b9-744d-40cf-ae66-165bb561eaa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddd1385f-a7f2-4cc8-bcc0-332c21b7acbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用一段代码捕获所有的异常，只需在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"except"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中不指定任何异常类即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"f4a059bf-3f20-440b-be43-924efba642c2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"49719dc7-7f10-40fd-955b-b567235730e5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    x = int(input('Enter the first number: '))\n    y = int(input('Enter the second number: '))\n    print(x / y)\nexcept:\n  print('Something wrong happened ...')","collabId":"fd8b255d-9d39-4cef-9bfe-35be5d1f5ee4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"ee07f5b7-658b-4fe4-b547-9dcc3bdab7b0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3e169327-dc94-443e-becb-78f591883bb2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"像这样捕获所有的异常很危险，因为这不仅会隐藏你有心理准备的错误，还会隐藏你没有考虑过的错误。"}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"4c8e273b-7f4b-4ac2-bc5e-6ee5974dd01d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a529a79-695a-490b-bffd-d22e8c22b434","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"finally"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句，可用于在发生异常时执行清理工作。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"d097a2e2-b8d2-4c79-b114-dd570635fd33","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dce62a99-f2ca-4a32-a82f-1d6d7a3b42d2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"x = None\ntry:\n    x = 1 / 0\nfinally:\n    print('Cleaning up ...')\n    del x","collabId":"d15b2668-e31a-449e-8ef4-9eb36459a9f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"4fe72400-c5f6-4e41-a486-75a2f1a63141","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f6b00a09-d11a-42cd-94e2-feea6d95e722","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"try:\n    1 / 0\nexcept NameError:\n    print(\"Unknown variable\")\nelse:\n    print(\"That went well!\")\nfinally:\n    print(\"Cleaning up.\")","collabId":"d06def77-b721-44be-948b-089d1f728a42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a793968-a29c-41f7-a074-38ec5e76b128","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"finally"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句非常适合用于确保文件或网络套接字等得以关闭。"}]}],"tags":["Python/异常"],"createTime":1719226565261,"updateTime":1791474923033,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923033}}